big Christmas challenge for you! My workshop's a bit of a mess, and presents are popping out all over the place, right into your house!\n\nYou'll grab gifts from moving belts and pack them as fast as you can. It's simple: gifts come in, you pack them up, and together we make sure Christmas is ready to go!\n\nThe game is easy to play but can get pretty zippy, like reindeer on a gingerbread sugar rush. But hey, that's part of the fun! It's all about quick hands, a sharp eye, and a heart full of holiday spirit.\n\nNo scores, no timers, just you saving the day one gift at a time. There's also a personal gift shop for you to treat yourself to some home decoration, like a lovely Christmas tree! So, what do you say? Grab your Quest and make some room,  let's see those present-packing skills in action!\n\nCheers and chuckles,\nSanta \ud83c\udf85\u2728", "short_description": "Ho Ho Ho! It's Santa here, and I've got a big Christmas challenge for you! My workshop's a bit of a mess, and presents are popping out all over the place, right into your house!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://privacy.fieldof.vision/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Field Of Vision", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://fieldof.vision/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25936296902706110"